    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Keep the detailed curriculum in its authoritative tracker**\n\nThe full curriculum, reference atlas, and learning gate are duplicated here even though line 112 names issue #206 as the exact working contract. When that working contract evolves without an identical `AGENTS.md` update, every bootstrapped agent receives stale instructions that conflict with the fresher tracker; keep only stable bootstrap invariants and a pointer here so this file does not become the prohibited second source of truth.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L3-L3](https://github.com/Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-shared-hq/blob/69c2e4ab386b78680e35d5b9ff83efa305c53048/AGENTS.md#L3-L3)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
